<title>USA: Coastal, Pertamina set Indian LNG sales.</title>
<headline>Coastal, Pertamina set Indian LNG sales.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coastal Corp said Monday it signed with Pertamina to develop liquefied natural gas import projects in India.</p>
<p>Coastal said it will develop LNG receiving terminals, natural gas pipelines and natural gas fired combined-cycle power projects in India.  Pertamina will develop and transport LNG from new and existing sources in Indonesia to supply fuel to the Coastal projects.  Pertamina, the world's largest supplier of LNG, is Indonesia's state oil company.</p>
<p>Coastal's statement provided no terms for the LNG agreement.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
